from __future__ import annotations

"""
Dual column-generation ADP for the two-hospital platelet inventory model.

Target computational environment for the reported runs:
Python 3.8.15 on Linux 6.8.0-124-generic, x86-64 architecture,
13.61 GB RAM, Gurobi Optimizer 13.0.2 through the gurobipy package.

This version uses Gurobi for the restricted master problem and performs exact
pricing over a user-supplied finite set of pricing states. 
"""

